      "text": "The dependence on the temperature is now visible in two places. By Proposition 4.1,\nlower \u03c4 makes the optimization target closer to the exact promptwise DRRO objective.\nBut in (4.8), the constant Ux grows with the dynamic range of exp((\u02c6r \u2212\u03b4\u03c0)/\u03c4), so low\n",
